silm:instances_papers_07_the_canonical_question_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_14_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor_6#droseiuniquemediator silm:hasLongDescription "The DrOseiUniqueMediator is Dr. Osei's unique mediator arrow u : colim D_Mittens -> VetCarePlan_77 admitted by the universal property. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'u', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
